-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(location)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (location)\">Adamantine Forge (location)</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longsword_Mould\" title=\"Longsword Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Longsword_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Longsword_Mould\" title=\"Longsword Mould\">Longsword Mould</a></span> required to forge <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\">Adamantine Longsword</a></span>\n<ul><li>Located in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>, high above the central chamber on an overhanging metal bridge at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-626&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;406</span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mace_Mould\" title=\"Mace Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Mace_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mace_Mould\" title=\"Mace Mould\">Mace Mould</a></span> required to forge <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Mace\" title=\"Adamantine Mace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Adamantine_Mac