re\">Nere</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Mould\" title=\"Shield Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Mould\" title=\"Shield Mould\">Shield Mould</a></span> required to forge <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\">Adamantine Shield</a></span>\n<ul><li>Located in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> on a skeleton at the very top of the stairs in the Dormitory, near the room with the Merregon Legionnaire and the Hellsboars at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-560&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;410</span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splint_Mould\" title=\"Splint Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Splint_Mould\" title=\"Splint Mould\">Splint Mould</a></span> required to forge <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Splint_Armour\" title=\"Adamantine Splint Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Spli